    [23059]={status="ok",name="Ring of the Dreadnaught",quality=4,tip="Item Level 92\nBinds when picked up\nUniqueFinger\n+27 Stamina\n+10 Defense\n+12 DodgeClasses: Warrior\n\nRequires Level 60\n\nDreadnaught's Battlegear (0/9)Dreadnaught Bracers\nDreadnaught Breastplate\nDreadnaught Gauntlets\nDreadnaught Waistguard\nDreadnaught Helmet\nDreadnaught Legplates\nDreadnaught Pauldrons\nDreadnaught Sabatons\nRing of the Dreadnaught\n\n(2) Set : Increases the damage done by your Revenge ability by 75.\n(4) Set : Improves your chance to hit with Taunt and Challenging Shout by 5%.\n(6) Set : Improves your chance to hit with Sunder Armor, Heroic Strike, Revenge, and Shield Slam by 5%.\n(8) Set : When your health drops below 20%, for the next 5 seconds healing spells cast on you help you to Cheat Death, increasing healing done by up to 160.\nSell Price: 6 2 56"},
    [23060]={status="ok",name="Bonescythe Ring",quality=4,tip="Item Level 92Binds when picked upUniqueFinger+20 Strength+20 Agility+10 Stamina+10 HitClasses: RogueRequires Level 60Bonescythe Armor (0/9)Bonescythe BracersBonescythe BreastplateBonescythe GauntletsBonescythe HelmetBonescythe LegplatesBonescythe PauldronsBonescythe SabatonsBonescythe WaistguardBonescythe Ring(2) Set : Your normal melee swings have a chance to Invigorate you, healing you for 100.(4) Set : Your Backstab, Sinister Strike, and Hemorrhage critical hits cause you to regain 5 energy. (500ms cooldown)(6) Set : Reduces the threat from your Backstab, Sinister Strike, Hemorrhage, and Eviscerate abilities.(8) Set : Your Eviscerate has a chance per combo point to reveal a flaw in your opponent's armor, granting a 100% critical hit chance for your next Backstab, Sinister Strike, or Hemorrhage.Sell Price: 6 2 56"},
    [23061]={status="ok",name="Ring of Faith",quality=4,tip="Item Level 92Binds when picked upUniqueFinger+16 Intellect+16 Spirit+55 Healing DoneClasses: PriestRequires Level 60Vestments of Faith (0/9)Belt of FaithBindings of FaithCirclet of FaithGloves of FaithLeggings of FaithRobe of FaithSandals of FaithShoulderpads of FaithRing of Faith(2) Set : Reduces the mana cost of your Renew spell by 12%.(4) Set : On Greater Heal critical hits, your target will gain Armor of Faith, absorbing up to 500 damage.(6) Set : Reduces the threat from your healing spells.(8) Set : Each spell you cast can trigger an Epiphany, increasing your mana regeneration by 24 for 30 sec. (Proc chance: 5%)Sell Price: 6 2 56"},
    [23062]={status="ok",name="Frostfire Ring",quality=4,tip="Item Level 92Binds when picked upUniqueFinger+10 Stamina+10 Intellect+14 Critical Strike+30 Spell PowerClasses: MageRequires Level 60Frostfire Regalia (0/9)Frostfire BeltFrostfire BindingsFrostfire CircletFrostfire GlovesFrostfire LeggingsFrostfire RobeFrostfire SandalsFrostfire ShoulderpadsFrostfire Ring(2) Set : Reduces cooldown on your Evocation by 1 minute.(4) Set : Gives your Mage Armor a chance when struck by a harmful spell to increase resistance against that school of magic by 35 for 30 sec. (Proc chance: 20%)(6) Set : Your damage spells have a chance to cause your target to take up to 200 increased damage from subsequent spells. (Proc chance: 20%)(8) Set : Your damage spells have a chance to displace you, causing the next spell cast to generate no threat. (Proc chance: 15%)Sell Price: 6 2 56"},
    [23065]={status="ok",name="Ring of the Earthshatterer",quality=4,tip="Item Level 92Binds when picked upUniqueFinger+16 Stamina+16 Intellect+37 Healing DoneRestores +6 mana per 5 sec.Classes: ShamanRequires Level 60The Earthshatterer (0/9)Earthshatter BootsEarthshatter GirdleEarthshatter HandguardsEarthshatter HeadpieceEarthshatter LegguardsEarthshatter SpauldersEarthshatter TunicEarthshatter WristguardsRing of the Earthshatterer(2) Set : Reduces the mana cost of your totem spells by 12%.(4) Set : Increases the mana gained from your Mana Spring totems by 25%.(6) Set : Your Healing Wave and Lesser Healing Wave spells have a chance to imbue your target with Totemic Power. (Proc chance: 10%)(8) Set : Your Lightning Shield spell also grants you 15 mana per 5 sec. while active.Sell Price: 6 2 56"},
